@startuml ref-observer
!include _style.puml
title Observer - GoF Reference Structure\n(Source: Gamma, Helm, Johnson, Vlissides. Design Patterns. Addison-Wesley, 1995)
interface Subject {
  +attach(Observer)
  +detach(Observer)
  +notify()
}
interface Observer {
  +update()
}
class ConcreteSubject {
  -subjectState
}
class ConcreteObserver {
  -observerState
}
Subject <|.. ConcreteSubject
Observer <|.. ConcreteObserver
Subject o--> "observers *" Observer
ConcreteObserver --> ConcreteSubject
note bottom : Subject notifies all Observers on change (1-to-N)
@enduml
